    "text": "Dauid w\u00e6s haten diormod h\u00e6le\u00f0, Israela br\u00ebga, \u00e6\u00f0el\u00e6 and rice, cyninga cynost, Criste liofost.\nW\u00e6s he under hiofenum hearpera m\u00e6rost \u00f0ara we an folcum gefrigen h\u00e6bben.\nSangere he w\u00e6s so\u00f0f\u00e6stest, swi\u00f0e ge\u00f0ancol to \u00f0ingienne \u00feiodum sinum wi\u00f0 \u00feane mildostan manna\nW\u00e6s se dryhtnes \u00f0iowa Dauid \u00e6t wige so\u00f0 sigecempa, searocyne man, casere creaftig, \u00feonne\nHw\u00eb\u00f0ere him geiode, swa ful oft gede\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6tte godferhte gylt gefr\u00e6mma\u00f0 \u00feurh lichaman lene ge\u00f0ohtas.\nGelamp \u00fe\u00e6t him mon ansende saula neriend, witgan mid wordum, weorada dominus, and secgan het,\nHim \u00f0a \u00f0ingode \u00feioda aldor, Dauid georne, and to dryhtne geb\u00e6d, and his synna hord selfa ontende,\nOnd eac efter menio miltsa \u00f0inra, dryhten weoruda, adilga min unriht to forgefenesse gaste minum.\nA\u00f0weah me of sennum, saule fram wammum, gasta sceppend, geltas geclansa, \u00fea \u00f0e ic on aldre \u00e6fre\nFor\u00f0an ic unriht min eal oncnawe, and eac synna gehw\u00e6r selfum \u00e6t eagan, firendeda ge\u00f0rec beforan\nNu ic anum \u00f0e oft syngode, and yfela feola eac gefr\u00e6mede, gelta gramhegdig, ic \u00f0e, gasta breogo,\nIc on unrihtum eac \u00f0an in synnum geeacnod w\u00e6s.\n\u00d0u \u00f0\u00e6t ana wast, m\u00e6htig dryhten, hu me modor geb\u00e6r in scame and in sceldum; forgef me, sceppend\nAc \u00f0u, selua god, so\u00f0 an lufast; \u00fey ic \u00f0e mid benum biddan wille lifes and lisse, liohtes aldor, for\u00f0an \u00f0u\n\u00d0u me, meahtig god, milde and bli\u00f0e \u00feurh ysopon ealne ahluttra, \u00feonne ic gecl\u00e6nsod Criste hero, and\nOntyn nu, elmehtig, earna hleo\u00f0or, \u00fe\u00e6t min gehernes hehtful weor\u00f0e on gefean bli\u00f0se for\u00f0weard to \u00f0e;\nAhwerf nu fram synnum, saula neriend, and fram misdedum minra gylta \u00feine ansione, \u00e6lmeahtig god,\n\u00c6c \u00f0u, dryhten Crist, cl\u00ebne hiortan in me, mehtig god, modswi\u00f0ne ge\u00f0anc to \u00f0olienne \u00f0inne willan and\nNe aweorp \u00f0u me, weoruda dryhten, fram ansione ealra \u00feinra miltsa, ne \u00f0ane godan fram me gast\nS\u00e6le nu bli\u00f0se me, bilewit dominus, \u00feinre h\u00e6lo heht, helm alwihta, and me, lifgende liohtes hiorde,\nSimle ic \u00f0ine weogas wanhogan l\u00e6rde, \u00f0\u00e6t hio arlease eft gecerdan to hiora selfra saula hiorde, god\nBefreo me an fer\u00f0e, f\u00e6der mancynnes, fram blodgete and bealani\u00f0um, god lifigende, gylta geclansa,\nOntyn nu, waldend god, weoloras mine; swa min mu\u00f0 sio\u00f0\u00f0an m\u00e6hte \u00f0ine and lof georne liodum to\nIc \u00f0e onsegednesse sona brohte, weoruda dryhtne, \u00f0er \u00f0u wolde swa, \u00f0a \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6t ne lufedest, lifes\nAc \u00f0e micle ma, mehtig dryhten, lifiende Crist, liicwer\u00f0e bi\u00f0 se gehnysta gast, hiorte geclansod and\nGedoo nu fr\u00e6msume frofre \u00f0ine to \u00f0inum godan gastes willan, \u00f0\u00e6tte Sione dun sigefest weor\u00f0e, and\nSwa \u00feu, frea meahtig, anfehst si\u00fe\u00f0an liofwende lac lioda \u00feinra, h\u00e6lend manna; hio \u00f0\u00e6t halige cealf on\nForgef me, lifigende meotod mancynnes, m\u00e6htig dominus, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0a sorhfullan saule wunde, \u00fea \u00f0e ic on\nSw\u00e6 \u00feingode \u00feiode aldor, Dauid to dryhtne, deda gemyndig, \u00fe\u00e6t hine m\u00ebhtig god mannum to frofre\nFor\u00f0on he gebette balani\u00f0a hord mid ea\u00f0mede inge\u00feance, \u00f0a \u00f0e he on fer\u00f0e gefr\u00ebmed h\u00e6fde, gastes\nForgef us, god m\u00e6ahtig, \u00fe\u00e6t we synna hord simle oferwinnan and us geearnian \u00e6ce dreamas an\nAmen.",
